    "body": "A second site has the same old `CuttingRow` literal. It is the unit test in `crates/tools/src/wire.rs:103` (added by PR #2140). Cargo shows it only after `wire_tool.rs` is fixed:\n\n```\ncrates\\tools\\src\\wire.rs:103:50: error[E0308]: mismatched types: expected `Option<WorkMaterial>`, found `WorkMaterial`\ncrates\\tools\\src\\wire.rs:103:27: error[E0063]: missing fields `stepdown` and `stepover` in initializer of `cutting_rows::CuttingRow`: missing `stepdown` and `stepover`\n```\n\nThe fix uses `CuttingRow::plain(Some(WorkMaterial::MildSteel), 0.0, 100.0)` there too. The test keeps its \"EDM conditions\" assertion.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
