    "updated_at": "2026-11-16T20:35:44Z",
    "body": "A third failure is on main. It shows only after the build is fixed. It is a test failure, not a build failure.\n\n- Test: `camcraft-kernel --test step_agreement`, `step_files_agree_or_refuse_by_name`.\n- Error: `a fixture has no row, or a row has no fixture - re-triage`. The file list has `fig8.step`, and `ROWS` has no row for it.\n- Cause: PR #2215 (merge acb6ce450, commit 6cf7cf991) added `testdata/models/fig8.step`. It did not add a row to the STEP agreement bench.\n- Reading: `solidcore refuses: #14 at read: pcurves failed on` and `no exact solid to judge against`. This is the same class as `fillet_corner.step`. truck reads the file.\n\nThe fix adds the row with this reading and the per-file test `step_fig8`. The same PR has the fix.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
